=== tree-basic
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Savings
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Rent
2024-01-01 * opening
    Assets:Bank:Checking   1500.00 EUR
    Assets:Bank:Savings    5000 EUR
    Assets:Cash              80.5 EUR
    Equity:Opening
2024-01-03 * rent
    Expenses:Rent           900 EUR
    Assets:Bank:Checking
2024-01-04 * food
    Expenses:Food            23.45 EUR
    Assets:Cash
--- out
Assets 5657.05 EUR
Assets:Bank 5600.00 EUR
Assets:Bank:Checking 600.00 EUR
Assets:Bank:Savings 5000.00 EUR
Assets:Cash 57.05 EUR
Equity -6580.50 EUR
Equity:Opening -6580.50 EUR
Expenses 923.45 EUR
Expenses:Food 23.45 EUR
Expenses:Rent 900.00 EUR
=== parent-own-postings
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash:Wallet
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-02 posted to every level
    Assets              100 EUR
    Assets:Cash          10 EUR
    Assets:Cash:Wallet    1 EUR
    Equity
--- out
Assets 111 EUR
Assets:Cash 11 EUR
Assets:Cash:Wallet 1 EUR
Equity -111 EUR
=== parent-own-postings-depth
