Equity -110 EUR
=== order-segment-wise
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets-Old
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Assets0
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open AssetsX:Y
2024-01-01 open Asset
2024-01-01 open assets
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-02 order
    Assets-Old   1 EUR
    Assets:Cash  2 EUR
    Assets0      3 EUR
    Assets       4 EUR
    AssetsX:Y    5 EUR
    Asset        6 EUR
    assets       7 EUR
    Equity
--- out
Asset 6 EUR
Assets 6 EUR
Assets:Cash 2 EUR
Assets-Old 1 EUR
Assets0 3 EUR
AssetsX 5 EUR
AssetsX:Y 5 EUR
Equity -28 EUR
assets 7 EUR
=== order-commodities
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 commodities
    A  1 USD
    A  2 AB
    A  3 B
    A  4 A
    A  5 EUR
    B
--- out
A 4 A
A 2 AB
A 3 B
A 5 EUR
A 1 USD
B -4 A
B -2 AB
B -3 B
B -5 EUR
B -1 USD
=== depth-two
--- args
balance
--depth
2
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking:Main
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Savings
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Equity:Opening:Year:2024
2024-01-01 * opening
    Assets:Bank:Checking:Main  10 EUR
    Assets:Bank:Savings        20 EUR
    Assets:Cash                 3 EUR
    Equity:Opening:Year:2024
--- out
Assets 33 EUR
Assets:Bank 30 EUR
Assets:Cash 3 EUR
Equity -33 EUR
Equity:Opening -33 EUR
=== depth-deeper-than-tree
--- args
balance
--depth
9
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-01 * opening
    Assets:Cash  3 EUR
    Equity
--- out
Assets 3 EUR
Assets:Cash 3 EUR
Equity -3 EUR
=== end-inclusive
--- args
balance
--end
2024-01-03
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 two
    A  2 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 three, on the end date
    A  30 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 four, after it
    A  400 EUR
    B
--- out
A 32 EUR
B -32 EUR
=== end-before-everything
--- args
balance
--end
2023-12-31
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 later
    A  2 EUR
    B
--- out
=== end-and-depth
--- args
balance
--depth
1
--end
2024-01-02
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open Assets:B
2024-01-01 open Income:X
2024-01-02 in
    Assets:A  5 EUR
    Assets:B  7 EUR
    Income:X
2024-01-03 out
    Assets:A  50 EUR
    Income:X
--- out
Assets 12 EUR
Income -12 EUR
=== zero-balances-left-out
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open Assets:B
2024-01-01 open Income
2024-01-02 move
    Assets:A  5 EUR
    Assets:B  -5 EUR
2024-01-03 net zero for C, not for D
    Income    1 USD
    Income   -1 USD
    Income    2 CHF
    Assets:A  -2 CHF
--- out
Assets -2 CHF
Assets:A -2 CHF
Assets:A 5 EUR
Assets:B -5 EUR
Income 2 CHF
=== scale-max-decimals
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 EUR scale 3 from one amount
    A  5 EUR
    A  1.250 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 USD scale 0, JPY scale 0
    A  7 USD
    A  100 JPY
    B
--- out
A 6.250 EUR
A 100 JPY
A 7 USD
B -6.250 EUR
B -100 JPY
B -7 USD
=== scale-from-assertion
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 the assertion is written with 4 decimals
    A  5 EUR = 5.0000 EUR
    B
--- out
A 5.0000 EUR
B -5.0000 EUR
=== scale-trailing-zeros-count
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 trailing zeros still count as written
    A  2.500000 EUR
    B  -2.5 EUR
--- out
A 2.500000 EUR
B -2.500000 EUR
=== negative-and-small
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open Liabilities:Card
2024-01-02 small amounts
    Liabilities:Card  -0.05 EUR
    Assets             0.05 EUR
--- out
Assets 0.05 EUR
Liabilities -0.05 EUR
Liabilities:Card -0.05 EUR
=== exact-sums-many
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 tenths
    A  0.1 EUR
    A  0.2 EUR
    A  0.3 EUR
    A  0.4 EUR
    B
2024-01-02 tenths again
    A  0.7 EUR
    A  0.3 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 large
    A  9999999999.99 EUR
    A  9999999999.99 EUR
    B
--- out
A 20000000001.98 EUR
B -20000000001.98 EUR
